---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Osteopathic Lecturing"
  description="Post-graduate continuous professional development (CPD) lectures & workshops in osteopathy."
>
    <div class="main-article">
    <h3>Osteopathic Lecturing</h3>

    <h4>What do you offer? </h4>
      <ul>
        <li>I offer independent, post-graduate lectures, courses & workshops, in the UK & internationally,
          on aspects of osteopathy.</li>
        <li>In the UK, these are mapped to the Osteopathic Practice Standards (OPS) & count towards
          continuous professional development (CPD).</li>

      </ul>
    <h4>What do you teach? </h4>
      <ul>
        <li>I specialise in an American osteopathic manipulative technique (OMT) called <b>Still Technique</b>.</li>
        <li>I've also lectured on manipulation, anatomy & osteopathic principles.</li>

      </ul>
    <h4>How do you teach? </h4>
    <img src="/lecturing-images/italy-2016-4.jpg" alt="Teaching in Italy" style="float: right; width: 400px; border-radius: 5px;">
      <ul>
        <li>I deliver in-person, practical workshops & online or in-person lectures.<br><br>
          Please take a look at an example of one of my webinars: <br><br>
          <iframe width="336" height="189" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/_EIGXtzWHYQ?si=dpwVvHSvYxqOoibI" title="YouTube video player" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allowfullscreen></iframe>
        </li>
      </ul>

    <h4>Who have you worked with?</h4>
      <ul>
        <li>In the UK: CPD Today, British school of Osteopathy (BSO), University College of Osteopathy (UCO),
          Manus Sinistra (UCO SU), College of Osteopaths, Central Sussex Osteopaths,
          London Osteopathic Society, Midlands Osteopathic Society, Waltham Forest Osteopathic Group and
        Northern Counties Society of Osteopaths (NCSO).</li>
        <li>In the EU: CPO Fulford DO (Italy), Rehaintegro (Poland), Panta Rhei (Netherlands), AASCOM (Belgium). </li>

      </ul>
      <img class="large-logos" src="/images/june-logos.png" alt="British School of Osteopathy" style="height: 180px; border-radius: 5px; margin-left: 40px">


    <h4>What are your qualifications & experience?</h4>
      <ul>
        <li>I have a Post-graduate Certificate in Academic Practice (PGCAP) & am a Fellow of the
          Higher Education Academy (FHEA).</li>
        <li>I have taught in academic & clinical roles at the UCO School of Osteopathy,
          part of the Health Sciences University (HSU),
          formerly the BSO/UCO, since 2002.  </li>
        <li>I have been delivering independent CPD lectures since 2010. </li>

      </ul>
      <img src="/lecturing-images/italy-2023-1.jpg" alt="Osteopathy in practice"
      style="float: right; width: 400px; border-radius: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px;">
    <h4>How much do you charge? </h4>
      <ul>
        <li>In-person workshops: day rate + expenses</li>
        <li>Lectures: fee negotiable depending on topic & length of lecture. </li>

      </ul>

    <h4>How do I book you? </h4>
      <ul>
        <li>Please contact me directly via my phone number, email or social media accounts. </li>

      </ul>

    <p><b>For a flavour of my Still Technique workshops, why not <a class="link-on-white" href="/files/gallery.html">have a look at the Gallery?</a></b></p>

    <br>
<br>
<br>
<b>I'm happy to answer any further questions when you contact me.
To make an appointment, please call +44 (0) 7871 836785
or email me at <a href="mailto:jonedisosteopath@gmail.com" class="link-on-white">jonedisosteopath@gmail.com </a></b>
    </div>
</Layout>
